[Music]  you know what time it is  sony have unveiled the playstation plus  games for august 2020  and it's a great month in my opinion  this month the games download on  different days so i'll be sure to shout  them out  first off is fall guys i've been waiting  for this for so long this is technically  a battle royale game in which only one  person can win  from 60 starting contestants the game is  made up of 25 mini-games  randomly selected until a winner is  crowned such a simple concept but  believe me  it's great it's possible to team up with  your friends and although you will be  against each other for the majority of  the game  you are guaranteed to be with your  friends during team-based  rounds if you've ever watched tekeshi's  castle or it's a knockout in the uk  you know what to expect complete chaos  and shenanigans  the game is a mixture of skill but  mainly its luck and timing  which makes it a great party game we  only have three abilities other than  running  jumping diving and grabbing the grabbing  parts  can be used to murk people which may see  a controller or two be thrown against  the wall  yes i did that but if you get in the  mindset of having fun and not winning  this is a great game i highly recommend  it there will be battle passes  introduced to unlock skins emotes and  colour schemes  to have your fall guy look exactly as  you want them to  as soon as custom games are available  i'll be getting as many of you guys as i  can together  to play as one big grenade family by the  way i'll link a video of my son and i  playing the pc beta last week if you  want to see what a full game looks like  fall guys is downloadable from tuesday  the 4th of august  the next game is another beast call of  duty modern warfare 2  remastered reliving the campaign which  made so many of us fall in love with  task force 141  price ghost gaz soap the gun play in the  remaster is sublime  and the updated graphics look on point  throughout and i'm sure you remember the  museum after finishing the game all  those years ago  well it's here too and it's just as  great as you remember  the story is gripping the set piece is  bombastic and overall this is a high  quality game to play  especially for free if you're a war zone  player you'll recognize many locations  in the game  including the original gulag i hope you  escape it this time  if you want to see the easter eggs and  secrets to look out for i have a video  for you  and you can see some of the unlockable  modifiers too the only thing to note is  that the multiplayer mode is not  included in this version of the game  this is a solo campaign only but don't  worry here's the best news of all  it's downloadable from tomorrow tuesday  the 28th of july  wow impressive so there we have it what  do you think  sadly i can't run a poll anymore for you  guys to rate the month but i still want  to know your thoughts  4 guys and modern warfare 2 ps plus is  looking great right now  i'm adam from playstation grenade it's  been a pleasure i'll see you next time

